  "description": "The Stay Strong Interceptor is part of their introductory level range, designed to get younger riders used to a BMX bike and ready for the leap up to the next size with specifically chosen geometry and specs to suit the individual rider. Though being an entry level bike, it's spec'd with parts usually seen on mid to pro range level bikes. Highlights of the inceptor 18\" include a Full Alloy frame construction for a huge weight saving compared to steel, Chromoly 3pc cranks, fully sealed bearings throughout, integrated Head tube and mid BB, 2.40\" tyres & 25/9t gearing with sealed cassette hub. Available in both 16\" and 18\" options for a solid, lightweight bike to help younger riders progress in the early days of BMX! ###section### Product Specs\n\nBuilt strong and lightweight Includes Sealed Bearings Sealed Rear Hub ###shogun-image-section###",
